Description: Wild OS light and dark mode in Kvantum
 The WildOS Kvantum theme has a dark variant (WildOS) and a light one
 (WildOSLight). Either name in kvantum.kvconfig now means the variant that
 matches the colour scheme applied, judged by its window colour as the Wild
 OS apps judge it. The style watches kdeglobals and loads itself again when
 light and dark mode switch or the accent changes, so apps that are open
 follow at sunrise and sunset instead of keeping the theme they started
 with. The Qt 5 style, a separate copy of the code, gets the same.
Author: Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>
Forwarded: not-needed

